---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Commodity trading"
  description="ArborSpace for commodity trading houses: capture the expert judgement behind each deal as readable rules."
  eyebrow="Solutions · Commodity trading"
  heading="Capture the judgement behind each deal."
  lead="Trading houses also sell expertise. ArborSpace turns that expertise into an ontology and a set of rules, applied to your data and reviewed by your people."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Your objects, linked</h2>
        <p>
          Counterparties, sites, shipments and contracts become business objects linked
          together, which teams and agents act on directly.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Rules you can read</h2>
        <p>
          Every conclusion traces back to a named rule and an explicit path of relationships,
          and every one goes through an expert before it counts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
